          "pattern": "\\bset\\s+aside\\b",
          "matched_text": "set aside",
          "start": 270,
          "end": 279
        }
      ],
      "text_preview": "That in light of the abovementioned facts and circumstances it is evidence that the impugned order dt. 03.07.2024 passed by the Ld. Court of JMFC suffers from severe irregularities, is bad in law, passed in complete non- application of judi"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "a259849624104d1d99e3d31a02e637e0_88",
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "labels": [
        "ARG_PETITIONER"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "explicit_leakage_phrase"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [
        {
          "pattern": "\\bset\\s+aside\\b",
          "matched_text": "set aside",
          "start": 48,
          "end": 57
        }
      ],
      "text_preview": "\n4. It is prayed that the impugned order may be set aside."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "f2fe4ea219bb465f90405c6f1e05bd3b_97",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "This court has considered the rival contentions."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "68ced31516864de8a395b4cb73424824_99",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "PRE_RELIED"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\n7. The entire law regarding exercise of jurisdiction U/s 156(3) Cr.P.C. by a Magistrate has been elaborated recently by the Hon'ble High Court of Delhi in Alok Kumar Vs. Harsh Mander 2023 SSC Online Del 4219."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "4fcd30a49d2946c49a5774285eaf64b5_100",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "PRE_RELIED"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "At Para 40, the Hon'ble High Court of Delhi has observed as under:\n\"To summarise, a conspectus of the above-mentioned judicial precedents reveal the following :\n(i). Power under Section 156(3) Cr. PC necessitates application of judicial min"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "058d37cfc46d4bc4a163b15b20f061b9_101",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "PRE_RELIED"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\n(ii) Such power is to be exercised in a judicious manner, and cannot be exercised mechanically or arbitrarily."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "0132e2aab81d4a5a8bb993905012022e_102",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "PRE_RELIED"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\n(iii) Magistrates cannot direct registration of FIR on mere asking of complainant.\""
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "66432ab2c400489a9262286d5f31e058_104",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "It is apparent from the above that a Magistrate has to apply his judicial mind while disposing of a prayer U/s 156(3) Cr.P.C. and that directions for registration of an FIR could not be passed in an arbitrary or mechanical manner."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "bb6a591de89b47e1813731ff224b3edd_105",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "9. It would be appropriate to reproduce the operative portion of the impugned order for a better understanding of the matter."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "1691d5bc9490441d9026a657c8fad545_106",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The relevant extracts are as under:-\n\"8."
    },
    {
