      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "This court has considered the preliminary inquiry as well as the report of the Vigilance Department along with the remaining record and submissions on behalf of the applicant."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "5ae65503d319440ca0957e6d42a4743b_108",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "9. On perusal of the entire material, this court finds that the allegations made in the application prima facie reveal commission of cognizable offences of such nature that police investigation is imperative."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "2608b113afcc4ee2bf2fdae0b5badd10_109",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The allegations include kidnapping for ransom at gunpoint, extortion, beating, criminal intimidation which are cognizable offences."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "24dc8e36f95c4dd98e00f1fcb90ef8e3_110",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\nThe Vigilance inquiry led to directions for creating historysheet for proposed accused no. 1 and transfer of proposed accused no.2, 3 and 4 to non- sensitive postings."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "2c5e0c3a410541169c4d5dbd89110d58_111",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\nThough there was a delay in filing complaint with the police, the nature of allegations is grave and requires detailed investigation."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "53abe01151b44eaea68dbfd24695056f_112",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "It is also noteworthy that the area of Sapna Cinema falls within the jurisdiction of PS Amar Colony and this court and the applicant was brought to an office near Sapna Cinema after being abducted from Jaipur, therefore, part of the alleged"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "34490df725734671bfc47e954231584a_113",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Sub Inspector Jai Kumar vs State on 4 December, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/177212609/\n7 LOVLEEN by LOVLEEN Crl."
    },
    {
