      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\n11. Keeping in view that some allegations have been levelled against police officials as well, this Court finds it appropriate to direct the DCP (South East) to supervise/\nmonitor the investigation of the present case\"\n10."
    },
